{"id":"5628","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5628_main_cirrus-fibratus-duplcatus-and-cumulus-humilis-and-fractus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是有两层的毛云种卷云（依据是近乎平直或有些不规则弯曲的丝条）。占主导下<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层为东西向排列</span>，而上<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层是南北向排列</span>。天空中还出现了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">晴天碎积云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，阿斯彭代尔花园VIC 3195","latitude":"纬度: 37° 48' 37'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 57' 16'' E","date":"13 January 2007 0827 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东东北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.11"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5628_syn_cirrus-fibratus-duplcatus-and-cumulus-humilis-and-fractus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>弱脊向东延伸，内陆槽向西北发展，</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2007，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5628_upper_cirrus-fibratus-duplcatus-and-cumulus-humilis-and-fractus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从地表到1200米（879 hPa）下沉逆温为不稳定层，从500 hPa到对流层顶有显著水汽</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5525_main_cirrus-fibratus-duplicatus-uncinus-spissatus-and-floccus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>图中显示出卷云的四个云种和一个云类。按当日的发展顺序，这些云种是：絮状、钩状、毛和密。云类是复云。</p>\n<p>圆凸起（积状云顶）可确定<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>为絮状云种。在下一个发展阶段，圆凸起开始消散，并变为云簇；这是钩状云种开始的特征，见<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">此处</span>。在这一阶段后，钩状云簇消散，留下在钩顶终止的逗号 – 异乎寻常的是，图中没有钩卷云这一阶段的明确实例。随后，风使这些钩状变形为不规则弯曲或几乎笔直的丝条（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛</span>云种）。逐渐地，毛状融合成浓密的云块（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密</span>云种）。</p>\n<p>复云类用于表示在两个不同高度排列的卷云。上层由几乎笔直或略微弯曲的细丝条（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>）构成。</p>\n<p>钩云种和毛云种的卷云为主，因此编码为CH = 1。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tze Ching Ho","location":"中国，香港，九龙城","latitude":"纬度: 22° 19' 51'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 11' 31'' E","date":"04 March 2016 1815 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.11"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4501_main_cirrus-fibratus-duplicatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>卷云纤维呈白色，较为纤细，外观上近乎笔直如丝，主要向两个方向延伸（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>），并且显然排列成两个重叠的层（双层纤状卷云）。由于透视效应，靠近地平线的卷云似乎有所聚集，但其丝状结构仍然可辨，即使在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>区域，该云层也不能被视为卷层云。该云系正逐渐侵占天空，并整体增厚。远处靠近地平线（主要在照片右侧）有一片平坦的极低云层，前景中可见与其相关的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎片</span>。这些云很可能属于坏天气的碎层云（地面风速13米/秒）。</p>\n<p>来自苏格兰北部的一个低压区，一条冷锋经北海和英格兰向西南延伸，同时爱尔兰南部形成一个波状结构。荷兰地区气压正在迅速下降。</p></div>","copyright":"© A.J. Aalders","location":"Bussum, Netherlands","latitude":"纬度: 52° 16' 26'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 9' 59'' E","date":"30 December 1948 1555 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 7, CM= 0, CH= 4","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}